AI Answer Assistant Privacy Safe

This project is a privacy-focused derivative/rewrite of functionality and code
from the following open-source project:

Original project:
  AI-ANSWER-ASSISTANT

Original repository:
  https://github.com/rehuan/AI-ANSWER-ASSISTANT

Original author / copyright holder:
  See the original repository and its commit history for applicable copyright
  notices and contributors.

Original license:
  GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

Major modifications in this project include:
  - Tampermonkey single-file userscript architecture
  - Removal of built-in telemetry/statistics endpoints
  - Removal of the built-in intermediary AI service
  - Removal of site-specific templates
  - Sanitized DOM / AI scanning
  - Session-only API key option
  - Debugging and request diagnostics
  - Multi-blank fill handling
  - Essay / short-answer support
  - Generic visible-choice interaction
  - Privacy-oriented network restrictions and documentation

